  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bandajuma - Liberian border road and bridges</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is the transformation from a poor gravel/earth road to a paved highway through two bridge improvements on the Sewa and Waanje river and an entirely new bridge over the Moa River on the Trans-West African Coastal Highway.</narrative>
  </description>
